{"id": "EUVD-2026-101252", "enisaUuid": "63925fab-b0b8-30c4-9d61-417cc5edf062", "description": "Papermerge Core through 3.5.3 contains a missing authorization vulnerability that allows authenticated users to list other groups' tags and document types by supplying a group_id parameter. Attackers who know a group's UUID can query GET /tags/all or GET /document-types/all, which skip the user_belongs_to check, to disclose metadata of groups they do not belong to.", "datePublished": "2026-10-14T14:17:00", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T16:15:28", "baseScore": 2.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/papermerge/papermerge-core/issues/1291", "https://github.com/papermerge/papermerge-core/blob/3.5.3/papermerge/core/features/tags/router.py#L39-L64", "https://github.com/papermerge/papermerge-core/blob/3.5.3/papermerge/core/features/document_types/router.py#L37-L62", "https://github.com/papermerge/papermerge-core/commit/0fd469102b05b5ebeb5ee39b3f73ff76991ab269", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/papermerge-core-through-3.5.3-missing-authorization-via-tags-all-and-document-types-all"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-110624", "GHSA-rj9j-qj76-253h"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.33, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "30670769-8988-32c9-9897-f689e4721fbe", "product": {"name": "papermerge-core", "vendor": {"name": "Papermerge"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22643.5.3"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "0469f988-605b-3731-a145-900757090291", "vendor": {"name": "Papermerge"}}], "isExploited": false}